    {
      "id": "s2022-e3-q04",
      "number": 4,
      "points": 8,
      "stem": "Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI). If the sequence $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ converges, then the series $a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\ldots$ converges.\n\nII). If the sequence $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ diverges, then the series $a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\ldots$ diverges.\n\nIII). If the series $a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\ldots$ converges, then the sequence $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ converges.\n\nIV). If the series $a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\ldots$ diverges, then the sequence $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ diverges.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "(I) and (IV)"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "(II) and (III)"
